--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO third-party binaries. (The optional `-with-BepInEx` release
archive does redistribute BepInEx unmodified; it carries all four third-party license texts
and a THIRD-PARTY.md manifest.) It contains only original
source code, build scripts and documentation. The following components are
required at build or run time and must be obtained by the user from their
original sources:

  BepInEx 5 (LGPL-2.1)                 https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
    Mod loader. Bundles HarmonyX and MonoMod. Not redistributed here; the
    README links to the official release.

  HarmonyX (MIT)                       https://github.com/BepInEx/HarmonyX
    Runtime patching library, shipped inside BepInEx as 0Harmony.dll.

  Mono.Cecil (MIT)                     https://github.com/jbevain/cecil
    Used only during research to read the game's IL. Not required to build
    or run this mod.

